# ── Large / redundant media, kept locally but out of git ─────
# GitHub hard-rejects any file over 100MB, and a committed blob
# stays in history forever even if deleted in a later commit.
# nypsu-hero.original.mp4 is the 246MB master; videos/nypsu-hero.mp4
# is the 7.8MB web encode that actually ships. campvid.gif is
# superseded by campvid.mp4 (same clip, 1/7 the size).
videos/*.original.*
videos/campvid.gif

# Editing leftovers
*.psd
*.ai
*.sketch
*.fig
